[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0010","text":"……啊，有猫"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0020","text":"不是“喵”的时候啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0030","text":"靠近火堆很危险的哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0040","text":"再烤焦的话，会被冬优子酱骂的哦\n像我这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0050","text":"不烫吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0060","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0070","text":"朝日，好像差不多要开始拍摄了……\n你刚才喊了冬优的名字？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0080","text":"猫跑掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0090","text":"……不过，结果还算不错呢\n没有烤焦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31700400_01_0100","text":"…………\n什么话题……？"}]
